    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "CONTROLS:\n  \u2022 [A] / [D] or [Left / Right Arrows] : Move Left & Right\n 
    \u2022 [Space] / [W] / [Up Arrow] : Jump (Hold for higher jump)\n  \u2022 [E]
    : Interact with Ancient Altar\n  \u2022 [Escape] : Pause Game & View Menu\n\nMISSION
    OBJECTIVES:\n  1. Traverse the prehistoric canopy platforms and chasms.\n  2.
    Find and collect all 3 Sacred Dragon Eggs (Emerald, Ruby, Sapphire).\n  3. Bring
    the eggs to the Ancient Altar and press [E] to unlock the Temple.\n  4. Enter
    the temple and recover the glowing Time Crystal to save the timeline!"
